-- 2026-11-19: Sean's idea, the podcast as the source of the social clips (playbook ve-podcast-studio). Safe to run twice.
insert into playbook_records (slug, brand_slug, author, body, source, kind, created_at)
select 've-podcast-studio', 'vegans-explore', 'Logan', $b$Idea from Sean 2026-11-19 (to build for next week and test against this week's social numbers): the podcast becomes the source of the social clips. (1) A Spotlight segment in each episode, from our interview archive: "In today's spotlight, we have An from Sen Saigon, who opens up about..." (Ep 147 An, the next episode Veronica of Love Life Cafe; then whoever else we have to feature). (2) Each segment is cut into its own social piece, not everything, enough to make what we post more dynamic: a news story River did, Nori's piece on New Zealand, what's new in the Directory shown with the visual Directory in the frame we decide. Sean: "we're dissecting the podcast, taking not everything, but enough that the content we put out is a little bit more dynamic than what we're putting out now. Let's build it up for next week and then test it out and see if we do better than this week." (3) SoFlo Vegans: Veronica may appear again as a clip on a timely topic; and a segment on the King Tide and the flooding: the root cause, why it happens more often now, why it is raining so much, with context. State 2026-11-19: Ep 147 (Sun Nov 22) and SoFlo 114 (Wed Nov 25) not started in the studio; the two spotlight reels (An, Veronica) are cut on the locked template, waiting on Sean's lock.$b$, 'text', 'decision', now()
where not exists (select 1 from playbook_records where slug='ve-podcast-studio' and body like 'Idea from Sean 2026-11-19%');
